          en: 'Behind their bubble shields the Pacifistas keep sinking the fleet, the giants have landed on the far side of the island, and one unexpected event follows another. Hound asks whether the Buster Call could be called off, although that would be unprecedented. [[guillotine|Guillotine]] will not have it: it was [[vegapunk|Vegapunk]] who gave a pirate power over the Pacifistas, which makes him a complete traitor to the Government and a major offender, and calling it off is not an option. To turn things around they have to take the machines back, and the order goes out to every vice admiral: leave your post and kill [[jewelry-bonney|Bonney]].',
